            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Cua 14",
            "review_text": "yongmengt2017\nSingapore, Singapore295 contributions\n0\nBánh Canh Cua 14 – A Hidden Gem Worth Visiting!\nOct 2026 • Friends\n🍜 Bánh Canh Cua 14 – A Hidden Gem Worth Visiting!\n\nA friend recommended this place, and I’m glad we gave it a try!\n\nFood:\nWe tried both the prawn noodle soup and the crab noodle soup, and both were absolutely delicious! The broth was flavourful, the seafood was generous, and the portions were more than satisfying. Definitely comfort food at its best!\n\nService:\nThe staff were friendly, attentive and helpful, making the whole dining experience pleasant.\n\nAtmosphere:\nA cosy, no-frills local eatery with a warm and welcoming vibe. The seating was comfortable too, so we could sit back and enjoy our meal.\n\nPrice:\nVery reasonably priced, especially considering the generous portions.\n\nOverall:\nA great recommendation from a friend! Delicious food, generous servings, friendly service and reasonable prices — what more could you ask for?\n\nDefinitely worth a visit and a must-try if you’re in Ho Chi Minh City! 🇻🇳\nRead more\nWritten October 10, 2026",
