            "review_text": "MaxManila\nManila, Philippines3292 contributions\n1\nSeafood Soup\nDec 2019 • Family\nOn our last night in HCMC, we went on a food trip. Banh Canh was our last stop before heading back to the hotel. We didn’t regret it as it was a good ender to all other small meals. \n\nTheir specialty is crab noodles. Super tasty and rich so expect to be full at the end of the meal. \n\nYou need to try their special scallop noodle soup. Aside from scallop, it contains crab, shrimp and cuttlefish in a big bowl of rich soup. Simply delicious. \n\nIf you’re also on a food trip mission, and don’t want to eat too much, one bowl can be shared by 2 persons. \n\nThis place is worth a return trip.\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2020",
